{"steam_appid":1944880,"steam_name":"Drop Command","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1944880/779472741/533fa1919fd2ec0569a52bf81d8dd66005549866/1781735383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781735691","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257361461/3050cf5097a27351bdf69aa7225e4fe42e91b720/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781735691","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/c4fd86e34650827eb1c9e9f5266608456a8c261f/ss_c4fd86e34650827eb1c9e9f5266608456a8c261f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790611206","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/362859f5a90cedd5debd564a555fafa9fb35f387/ss_362859f5a90cedd5debd564a555fafa9fb35f387.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790611206","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/dc3cfbd33cff563b5ada12a91abe12c849953e96/ss_dc3cfbd33cff563b5ada12a91abe12c849953e96.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790611206","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/58bf60f80627e06197ff5f139892930e324ee6c4/ss_58bf60f80627e06197ff5f139892930e324ee6c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790611206","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/eccfcc3bae98afb291865428067f9f47b20aeedc/ss_eccfcc3bae98afb291865428067f9f47b20aeedc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790611206"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.poster.avif?t=1790611206\" width=780 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.webm?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.mp4?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech combat at a grand scale</strong>: Engage in <strong>combined arms combat</strong> where you pilot any unit under your command. From small skirmishes to epic battles, conquer rivals as you build a stellar empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/da86163ad2b5e3cd98c888a92f6fa740.poster.avif?t=1790611206\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/da86163ad2b5e3cd98c888a92f6fa740.webm?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/da86163ad2b5e3cd98c888a92f6fa740.mp4?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop into combat</strong>. Either alone, leading your squad, or commanding an army. Take part in the evolving battlefield, with <strong>fully destructible debris</strong> and unit wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/00d6036f86e9ccac026168849e76da50.poster.avif?t=1790611206\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/00d6036f86e9ccac026168849e76da50.webm?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/00d6036f86e9ccac026168849e76da50.mp4?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize and level up your pilots</strong> as they gain experience. Build elite squads of battle hardened soldiers, or rush your opponent with disposable rookies. <strong>Personalize your empire</strong> and <strong>modify  your Mech</strong>, Tank, VTOL, or Battle Armour to suit the mission at hand.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/ec2ad9a6ff7bdaaa800f0f22195d8e42.poster.avif?t=1790611206\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/ec2ad9a6ff7bdaaa800f0f22195d8e42.webm?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/ec2ad9a6ff7bdaaa800f0f22195d8e42.mp4?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wage war</strong> across the star cluster in a procedural campaign. <strong>Face logistic and tactical decisions</strong> as you vie for control of strategic resources, pivotal systems, manufacturing hubs, and political objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/64cdd2f0cb14d320f901ae2461107764.poster.avif?t=1790611206\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/64cdd2f0cb14d320f901ae2461107764.webm?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/64cdd2f0cb14d320f901ae2461107764.mp4?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed or failed mission objectives will have <strong>serious consequences</strong> as they impact future campaign operations. <strong>Champions will rise</strong> across the cluster, and establish pirate factions, mercenary companies, or even rival empires!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/8c6f85ff72ab73ec39cae74ddb4d30e9.poster.avif?t=1790611206\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/8c6f85ff72ab73ec39cae74ddb4d30e9.webm?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/8c6f85ff72ab73ec39cae74ddb4d30e9.mp4?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conduct diplomacy</strong> with planetary governments and rivals. Strike a balance between empire growth and peaceful coexistence, or wage war without regard to the consequences...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/3fdfb2352e3a3baaae61c6d124630e75.poster.avif?t=1790611206\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/3fdfb2352e3a3baaae61c6d124630e75.webm?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/3fdfb2352e3a3baaae61c6d124630e75.mp4?t=1790611206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100/AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K/AMD Ryzen 7 1700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["PillBugGames"],"publishers":["PillBugGames"],"release_date":"Sep 28, 2026"}